{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有：Y的音乐细节和感受颗粒度不如X，尤其缺少随乐句推进而出现的细微变化，情绪层次也略显概括。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"Y把每段发生了什么、人物为什么这样想和这样做，以及前后心理变化交代得更连贯，普通观众更容易跟住整条情感线。X的重点高亮、短句和分时出现的感受更便于扫读，也更细密地贴合音乐变化；但部分感受过于密集，容易让观众沉浸在局部意象中而忽略人物的心理进程。综合来看，Y更容易让人听懂、跟住并理解这个故事。\"} </escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c518024b-3e8e-444d-a18c-5b6c5566acba", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T164208397830Z", "elapsed_seconds": 46.0, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T16:42:54.410708+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8345d066fc46ae4545d1e6003299a14c052ea1ebe7283834b711c773333d6c3d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screensho